# App deploy

- App basename `<app>` → `/workspaces/<app>/.iac/`.
- Required: `iac.yml` (plain: `image_name`, `app_domains`), `docker-compose.yml`, SOPS `.env`.
- No infra keys in `iac.yml` — those belong in `secrets/infra.yml`.
- Commands: `task app:deploy -- <env> <app> <7-char-sha>`, `task app:versions -- <env> <app>`.
- Role: `ansible/roles/deploy_app/`.
